      "LAVONA: Wrooooong!.. Ordinary. Nothing special there.\nLAVONA: Are you even trying. Cause there’s other places I’d fucking rather be... Concentrate. Is that what you call a clean skate, for Christ sake?\nSKATER MOM: Could you not swear in front of the kids please, Lavona?\nLAVONA: I didn’t swear, you cunt. Stop talking to her! That girl is your enemy. You’re not here to make friends.",
